{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mr5g2h4k0sd","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"Run 13 warm start recall trusted a vacuous UNKNOWN program and never entered repair","summary":"SPEC IS INCOMPLETE: The EWM run-13 ls20 warm start recalled the dev ceiling program WHOLE and got 31 live divergences with repair_attempts=0 and synthesis_attempts=0 for two compounding reasons, both fixed in run 14.\n\nReason 1 (vacuous trust): the recalled ceiling program renders every unmodelable cell UNKNOWN, and validate() SKIPS UNKNOWN cells, so it passed the fresh probe suite VACUOUSLY and was adopted whole on the strength of a skip. Fix: _orient now re-measures CHANGED-cells accuracy over the fresh probes (the non-vacuous metric partial adoption already uses) before whole-adopting; a program that only passes vacuously is routed through the masked partial path or refused. New telemetry RunSummary.orient_revalidation={probes, pass_rate, adopted_as}.\n\nReason 2 (repair never engaged): the recalled program hard-codes is_win=False, so the planner never found a goal, _plan returned None, and the loop hit the reactive path every turn. _handle_divergence (which calls _repair) was ONLY reachable from the planned-EXECUTE expect_mismatch, which an unplannable program never reaches. Fix: the plan-empty branch now checks _live_diverged() (did the last observed single-step transition mispredict the active program) and routes it into _handle_divergence -> REPAIR with the failing live transition, instead of a blind reactive probe.\n\nCompounding: an accepted repair of a recalled program now supersedes the KB note it came from (_orient_note_key threaded into write_program_revision(supersedes=...)).\n\nLocation: bench/arc_agi3_zonoid/ewm/agent.py (_orient, _live_diverged, run loop plan-empty branch, _maybe_write_program), driver.py surfaces orient_revalidation. Note that the driver reports summary field 'divergences' = reactive_turns, not expect_mismatch events -- this is why run 13 showed 31 divergences with 0 repairs.","category":null,"tags":[],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-07-03T21:27:33.428Z","vec":[-0.06123550236225128,0.0027814190834760666,0.006348978728055954,0.061958178877830505,0.052744489163160324,-0.06600194424390793,-0.07680529356002808,0.053500089794397354,-0.04082341492176056,0.016785191372036934,0.06932301074266434,-0.0069533297792077065,0.02467896230518818,-0.04581698030233383,-0.007809742819517851,-0.01554358284920454,-0.0008057627710513771,-0.007591737899929285,-0.07150248438119888,0.05311848223209381,-0.006458669435232878,0.04324928671121597,0.03482227772474289,0.05581246688961983,-0.023313777521252632,-0.037007540464401245,-0.0340711735188961,0.03971414268016815,-0.026557188481092453,-0.05291949585080147,-0.013192160055041313,0.10228343307971954,-0.0702565610408783,-0.004520456772297621,0.08549720048904419,0.057230960577726364,-0.09058518707752228,-0.030010772868990898,-0.07364547252655029,-0.040895361453294754,0.007513249292969704,0.018236784264445305,-0.0395452119410038,0.000028948636099812575,0.006994274910539389,-0.026135342195630074,-0.04723762348294258,-0.04442453384399414,-0.017832104116678238,-0.03948652371764183,-0.0167981069535017,0.026168810203671455,0.03536786139011383,0.0341733954846859,0.007477555423974991,0.06432682275772095,0.041458290070295334,0.015349453315138817,-0.03297916427254677,-0.06377891451120377,0.010747667402029037,-0.056748226284980774,-0.0721634104847908,-0.09016517549753189,-0.018709370866417885,0.03747670724987984,0.024686334654688835,-0.09689246118068695,0.08220724761486053,-0.020253576338291168,-0.022598953917622566,0.04435213655233383,-0.007980982773005962,0.002941393293440342,0.049868144094944,0.0926135703921318,0.0008998168632388115,0.006110472604632378,0.010732974857091904,-0.09532198309898376,-0.04455088824033737,-0.0005330453859642148,-0.028931928798556328,-0.021027281880378723,0.04669776186347008,-0.02224956452846527,-0.0053084720857441425,0.03539860248565674,0.12552854418754578